('virtual-assistant-article-release-notes', 'Release Notes for Virtual Assistant Services Article Updates', 'release notes', 'Release notes help future reviewers understand what changed in a public article and why the change matters to its reader.', 'route, change summary, reason, evidence, affected links, reviewer, and follow-up trigger', 'Support can draft and archive notes; the editor approves the public change and its description.'),
('virtual-assistant-article-brief-archive', 'Archive Article Briefs Without Losing Virtual Assistant Services Context', 'brief archives', 'An archive should preserve the reasoning around an article brief so an old idea is not mistaken for an approved current assignment.', 'original question, decision status, reason for deferral, evidence gathered, related routes, and reopening condition', 'A virtual assistant can preserve and retrieve the record; an editor decides whether an archived idea should return to the active queue.'),
